    engine2d_vulkan_window_8k_gate_is_device_present_proxy_2026-08-31, 1, "2026-11-13: Blocked on this host: no Xvfb. Static confirmation at release/1.0.0 c8c3e7bc4f1, Linux aarch64 (DGX Spark GB10), Rust seed af717f53d6bce3e5: in bench_window_swapchain_present_8k_one_percent_damage the checksum folds the host source vector, not the presented frame (vulkan_graphics_runtime_swapchain.rs), so the gate still proves device present only. The fix is in that ignored Rust test plus the gate script and needs cargo --features vulkan with a display."

